  "code": "struct POINT(x: double, y: double) is\n    =~(other: POINT) -> bool => x == other.x /\\ y == other.y;\n\n    get_hash_code() -> int => System.HashCode.combine(x, y);\nsi\n\nlet origin = POINT(0.0D, 0.0D);\nlet right = POINT(1.0D, 0.0D);\nlet zero_zero = POINT(0.0D, 0.0D);\n\nassert origin =~ zero_zero;\nassert origin !~ right;",
